{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207080/extras/616641c6720c215eebe8198a89b229a0.avif?t=1773403502\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Keplerian Space Discovery is a realistic spaceship trajectory simulator game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our solar system</strong> is built to scale and rendered with lifelike graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Furthermore</strong>, the motion of each celestial body is precisely simulated using <strong>Kepler's laws</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players can construct</strong> their own rocket by assembling various components.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Me to the Moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, let's go to the moon, the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's one big step for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rabbits.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207080/extras/d886984258af36e6c6090353ec0b4354.avif?t=1773403502\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Policy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be streamed or have videos posted without prior permission, whether you are an individual or a company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on monetization or which parts of the game you can showcase.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3207080?t=1773403502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773403502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207080/dcf7972f3b71a6a4228ecac6c7b33a05c1f1fabd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773403502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207080/dcf7972f3b71a6a4228ecac6c7b33a0